          "description": "Let their light shine with Firefly and start the day with a spark! Introducing a joyful yet calming soundtrack for busy mornings, big feelings, and family time. Packed with mindful, upbeat songs about food puns, superhero friends, and seeing the magic in everyday moments, this album by Claudia Robin Gunn features sunny singalongs and thoughtful affirmations. This award winning New Zealand-to-USA collaboration is produced by (and features) Dean Jones plus special guests Little Miss Ann and Suzy Shelton. Let Firefly be your new accompaniment for creative crafting or road trips and fall in love with these feel-good tunes with big-hearted messages, bringing playful grooves and musical smiles wherever you go.    Having traded nightclubs for nightlights when her babies arrived on the scene, Claudia Robin Gunn has been humming her way through the rockabye rollercoaster of family life ever since, collecting plenty of smiles, music awards and warm fuzzies along the way. Firefly is her 6th full length album.",
